{"title":"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 31","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/6/036b1633f92a06d4ebc424d14806e576816d7548.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+2x+5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"90\" height=\"16\" /> to be a factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/c/5ac53dc6f21a2e490eb1f6ec0e3342fc457047a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4+px^2+q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"98\" height=\"18\" />, the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> must be, respectively:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/c/56c311626297cef771530bd8e67926542ddc3161.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -2, 5\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 5, 25\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 10, 20\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 6, 25\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 14, 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"511\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the other quadratic be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/c/90c5564f009b97ee76a3de4fb20bce56a14339d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + bx + c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/c/a2ceae509cec3e31a1ad7bc09d34f40507d0f16f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^2 + 2x + 5)(x^2 + bx + c) = x^4 + px^2 + q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"332\" height=\"21\" />.  Multiply the two quadratics to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/9/43952ec87fee31f5ba3b62f0376df2d328246ba5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^4 + (b+2)x^3 + (c + 2b + 5)x^2 + (2c + 5b)x + 5c\\]\" width=\"385\" height=\"19\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/f/1ff6762d54b6918df82e3965e6f18d12b4730cc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4 + px^2 + q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"98\" height=\"18\" /> have no <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/5/48524d3889ec8433cb03669176e738011df245b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> term and no <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> term, the coefficients of these terms must be zero.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/9/1e97057e4b00f97a2747331be5efdeeda2e6b063.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b+2=0\\]\" width=\"71\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/1/b31ae18fcfd50addaa02748094e8e85b77d74a2e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b=-2\\]\" width=\"54\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/2/8021e9c02ea5cf33f731abee9d446fdddf18d250.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2c+5b=0\\]\" width=\"88\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/d/40d46d46c7816c7b2892f4af8a900ed5ea471da8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2c-10=0\\]\" width=\"89\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/d/7fd70074575b3becb4b1fb942fcd54f5d36f5c14.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[c=5\\]\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />\nSubstitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> back to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/1/9c1b7e49edc32c4eb8a63569ec13f2f10b3380d9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^4 + 6x^2 + 25\\]\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" />\nThus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/1/e118483b349bf51c2f1b7a76b29de0470c136fe9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/b/56b15fc12d38c718ae2f8eca6137da09e4ab054a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q=25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693c4044f8526a8179956e8ac7a3f2f9d61e2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME\" title=\"1960 AHSME\">1960 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems\" t